      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `52ae5f9d2c4a0e8e3c5205681a91412538c10cf9e913af61748022d310748a59--45130do004_200809.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2008-09\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 15 of 15\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 3430ac44d547dfafd525592bd1d17e468ea9b78eb6d91ac71fd8a21cd17da109 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 7af050966901a37ce9eba4df5531fce0cfa040bb2ab3ce00bcc3dcbb57c87be9 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 20139042f26d38ae1179e9b57abb7e854ab70b5675ba04d2f88e207a791a5db7 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | b28db8d779ad29234f044a73f10c38c6316654c083fd0488d5ce53ecbfee4836 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 9407a461af6c5ed4e7240f4407de565eb5665bec03b8140d5a7530e0bc380288 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | dc601f1e62ef6a8f936822486078ca893c224772e7ccfe54cd5558d9229ab47d | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 17d8f9053ae1c44119cc21782e24bb7b8fe741a63f963188c66e93efc2ea5bc3 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 1e0d6d989266eb01166be9fb39260e1097c7588d10e7862251df1cec677056c2 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 03bb54f332aaad82e35c0e88c8dbecac5684e05c18fdf1779de316168d8b60a8 | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | d87924ff75d7d8a2c1a8259dd64ad7fc51248e62b8528266f17871b8963ee955 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | 117267cbb999a785910b774d67bab64f4152bd0a9b1f2cf3ff0a7a4e4f3f7f1f | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | a71070d4261fbaa9269bfbaaf84486035cd2c7ef7c3f30c6571f87addb6135a3 | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | 4b64b8e2fbf6e3f93c26cfffecfdd6ee4b9fcd6b5c941fea187247a284aa034f | missing |\n| \"Table_13\" | ec191ec6b3b2c32d2da502e281022657d4791765af666c653efb768493ca5dfc | missing |\n| \"Table_14\" | 7a0657ac1e81278d07d0153150e5d475617c9973e1a9e1b16afc1e9f260faadc | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
